Server init.

>> x := Blob nei: 65 typ: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Programm astellung: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server verbannen: (
 Lëscht nei ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Lëscht nei ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x vun: 0 längt: 1), nei-zeil.
x fräiginn.

